# Frontend design scope (FOAM)

Any marketing/landing-page design preferences (hero composition, brand-first landing viewport, full-bleed hero, anti-generic-landing patterns, etc.) apply **only** to the existing FOAM **web marketing / landing-page** UI.

They must **not** govern:

- React Native or Expo
- FOAM Driver or FOAM OPS (web consoles or native)
- native navigation
- native mobile components
- mobile UX patterns

For product UI (booking, account, ops, driver) and for all mobile work, follow existing FOAM product/project rules and platform-appropriate patterns instead of landing-page marketing rules.
